<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114689" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Eu.</u>
			241
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράω</span> (B) A): <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oracular, prophetic,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφετμαί</span> l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστηρίαν ἐσθῆτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1270
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίπους χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1320
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					822
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄπολλον χρηστήριε</span>”
				<i>author of oracles,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.80
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				312
			</span></i> (Aegae, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράομαι</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστικός</span>
			, <i>fitted</i> or <i>designed for use, useful,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστήρια σκεύη</span>
			<i>household</i> utensils or furniture, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				27
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὸς θεωρίαν ἢ θυσίαν ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					10.11
				</span></i>
			); without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Mnemos.</u>
				57.208
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				326.30
			</span></i> (Teos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα σκύτινα τῶν ὅπλων καὶ τῶν χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					13.1.48
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				106J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν περίβολον καὶ τὰ ἐν αὐτῷ χ.</span>”
				<i>Expl.Arch.de Délos</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.291
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				120
			</span></i>, Durrbach <i>Choixd' inscr.de Délos</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δώματα καὶ τὰ χ. τῶν ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					8.170
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				764.37
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
